        bookId: 'words-of-radiance',
        text: "Adolin hooked Elit Ruthar into a duel and nearly punched Sadeas. He was then taken with the newly arrived Shallan Davar, who brought news of Jasnah's death. After some flirting, their causal betrothal was confirmed.",
