        bookId: 'words-of-radiance',
        text: "Disguised as Dalinar in Renarin's Plate, Adolin met Eshonai, who told him the Parshendi now sought the Alethi's destruction rather than peace. He then won Elit's Shards by draining his Plate of Stormlight, and goaded Relis into a duel against Adolin and any partners he brought.",
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'words-of-radiance', chapter: '53' }],
