        text: "Back in the Physical Realm, Syl fought as Kaladin's weapon in the Battle of Thaylen Field. Afterward they discussed whether fighting the singers was right; Kaladin chose to keep fighting for humanity and promised never to kill her or any other sapient spren. They then went to rescue Skar and Drehy, who had brought Gavinor out of Kholinar.",
