        text: 'About a year after Thaylen Field, Syl and Kaladin slipped into Hearthstone among refugees and barely escaped a fight with the Fused Lezian. Syl badgered Kaladin about how tired he looked, entertained his brother Oroden, told his mother Hesina that he and Lyn had split up, and went with him to see his father.',
