        text: 'Syl became a dulled sword so Kaladin could spar with Zahel, though they lost. When his parents arrived, she eagerly showed them the rooms she and Kaladin had prepared and prompted Kaladin to tell Lirin he had retired and wanted to help in his clinic.',
