        text: 'Syl is cheerful and mischievous, fond of jokes and pranks, irreverent and sometimes forgetful. She is relentlessly optimistic and sees the best in people. She has a playful proud streak, calling herself a tiny piece of god, and an endless curiosity about people that leads her to spy on them invisibly with little sense of propriety.',
