        text: 'Syl usually appears as a tiny young woman in a flowing, girlish dress, barefoot, with hair that fades into mist, all glowing blue-white; she can also become a ribbon of light, leaves or a cloud, and is invisible to most unless she chooses. In Shadesmar she is human-sized and cannot change form.',
