        bookId: 'well-of-ascension',
        text: 'When Vin refused to leave with him, Zane attacked her, exposing TenSoon. TenSoon hinted at a weakness that let her seize control of him with a duralumin-enhanced Soothing. Though Zane burned atium, Vin used his own foresight against him and killed him with a stab to the neck.',
