        bookId: 'bands-of-mourning',
        text: 'Huge statues of Vin and Elend stood over their tomb in the Field of Rebirth, and a sunken black marble statue of her stood in a New Seran graveyard. Ranette named her gun Vindication after her, and artwork showed her rising above ravens or slaying the Lord Ruler.',
