        bookId: 'hero-of-ages',
        text: "As Emperor, Elend and Vin went after the Lord Ruler's storage caches. They found one in Statlin City, scouted Urteau under Quellion's control, and took Vetitan, seizing ten thousand koloss and moving its people inward. That cache held the first eight metals and pointed to the last, in Fadrex City under Aradan Yomen.",
