        bookId: 'hero-of-ages',
        text: 'Returning, overwhelmed, Elend knelt in the ash and nearly gave up. The mist spirit appeared and answered his yes-or-no questions with gestures, warning him not to attack Fadrex, pointing to his metal vials and hinting that Ruin might be beaten. It died soon after.',
