        bookId: 'hero-of-ages',
        text: "In Luthadel Elend found Penrod's body and a note he realized Ruin had altered, then went to the Pits of Hathsin. There he recognized that those longest sick from the mists were Seers and armed them with the atium cache, fighting the koloss for hours until the atium ran low and Marsh appeared.",
