        bookId: 'shadows-of-self',
        text: 'Remembered as the Last Emperor, Elend gave his name to the city of Elendel, whose laws, written by Spook, rest on his ideals. His body, restored by Harmony, lies beneath giant statues of him and Vin at the Field of Rebirth.',
