        bookId: 'bands-of-mourning',
        text: 'Edwarn arrived claiming to know how to open the final door, and Wax let him join. The chamber was empty, and Telsin, whom Wax had suspected, shot him. Falling into a pit, he was buried by a trap Edwarn triggered. Wax told the grieving Wayne to keep fighting, and died.',
