        bookId: 'bands-of-mourning',
        text: 'Before Harmony, Wax berated him for his inaction and for Lessie. Harmony showed him a glimpse of a greater conflict and offered another adventure, which Wax accepted. He woke healed, holding the true Bands of Mourning, which Marasi had placed in his hand.',
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'bands-of-mourning', chapter: '28' }],
