        text: "On a rooftop, Telsin tried to talk Wax out of opposing the Set, but he saw she feared he would ruin her plans and didn't realize how much he had changed. Slipping away, he searched Mayor Entrone's mansion while Wayne caused a distraction, and found a hidden tunnel.",
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'lost-metal', chapter: '46' }],
