        text: "Assaulting the Shaw, Wax flanked the Set's soldiers while Wayne posed as him. Briefly using a trellium earring, he warned Telsin, then fought his way up through hundreds of soldiers with the Big Gun. At the top, Wayne persuaded the remaining guards to flee.",
