        text: "In New Seran, Wayne and Marasi hunted for ReLuur's spike. Bribing the gravekeeper Dechamp to dig up ReLuur's grave, they were ambushed by Set gunmen who killed Dechamp. Wayne was delighted to learn criminals feared him so much, and the pair drove the attackers off.",
