        text: "Marasi was the illegitimate daughter of Jackstom Harms, making her Steris's half sister. Constantly told she was useless as an heir and as an Allomancer, she grew determined to accomplish something. Fascinated by criminals and lawkeepers and inspired by tales of Wax in the Roughs, she moved to Elendel for university with her father's support, posing as Steris's cousin from the Outer Estates.",
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'alloy-of-law', chapter: '14' }],
