        bookId: 'elantris',
        text: "Hrathen accompanied the monks in their assault on Kae, sickened throughout. He saw Sarene captured, learned that Dilaf's hatred of Elantrians came from his beloved being driven mad by a badly drawn Aon, and saw a monk burned body and soul to carry Dilaf, Sarene and others to Teoras.",
