        bookId: 'elantris',
        text: 'In Teoras, the monks planned to kill King Eventeo under the pretense of his conversion. When Hrathen saw that Dilaf meant to murder Sarene in front of her father, he realized that his respect and rivalry for her was love, and he attacked Dilaf to save her.',
