        text: "Hrathen's body was carried back to Elantris and buried in the memorial barrows beside Eondel, Karata, Saolin and Roial, his red armor beside him and his cape over his sword. Speaking at his funeral, Sarene admitted she had never seen his inner conflict or his willingness to put others first, and asked the people to remember him as their savior.",
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'elantris', chapter: 'epilogue' }],
