        text: "As the first daughter of King Dedelin of Idris, Vivenna was raised to marry the God King of Hallandren as the peace treaty required, and was due to go to T'Telir at twenty-two. But Dedelin, who favored her because she reminded him of his late wife, sent her younger sister Siri instead.",
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'warbreaker', chapter: '1' }],
