        text: "Vivenna is the tallest of the Idrian princesses and is considered beautiful. A descendant of Vo, she has the Royal Locks and can change her hair's color and length, eye color and even add scars; she is unusually good at keeping her hair from showing emotion. Vasher trained her as an Awakener.",
