        text: 'Azure looks like a lean Alethi woman in her mid-thirties, a little short by Alethi standards, with light orange eyes, straight black hair to mid-cheek and two scars across her face. She wears gloves, an azure cloak often wrapped around her left arm and a mail coif, and often carries her helm.',
