        bookId: 'warbreaker',
        text: 'Finding Vivenna unknowingly helping Denth stir up trouble in the city, Vasher kidnapped her and made her hold Nightblood. It sickened her, proving her heart pure, and earning his protection. She fled back to Denth, discovered his treachery and ended up on the streets, where Vasher found her and used Nightblood to kill the thugs threatening her.',
        revealedIn: [{ book: 'warbreaker', chapter: '41' }],
