        text: 'Vasher and Shashara, who had fallen in love and married, worked together to Awaken a sapient metal object with Shashara the more talented Awakener. After long thought they gave it the Command "destroy evil," not realizing it could not know what evil was, and used a thousand Breaths to create Nightblood.',
