        text: "Through a vision in the Spiritual Realm while watching the Everstorm, Vasher met December, who told him of Miral's crisis. Moved, he promised to help, but could not leave Roshar. He finally sent a remotely controlled simulacrum of himself, though Miral's people had already solved the problem.",
