        text: "As a Returned, Vasher can change his appearance at will. In T'Telir he usually appears as a tall man in ragged brown clothes with rope-tied trousers, shoulder-length unkempt hair and scruff. Revealing his Returned form, he becomes taller, muscular and clean-shaven, with golden hair and a color-enhancing aura.",
