        text: "Hoid became involved in Marasi's sting in Bilming, silently watching Moonlight across trucks. He gave Wax a ride in a sleek black car, traded his harmonica to Wayne for a rat he named Sir Squeekins, and rescued Wax from the ocean in a small boat after the Pewternaut exploded.",
